  birdName: Kiwi
  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: a0bb4a1bcda85ef47af3c32a0cc104a3, type: 3}
  description: "During the day, Kiwi sells fruit to anyone who comes by its fruit
    stand. At night, Ninja Kiwi blends the meanest smoothies around the block. Rumor
    has it no one has seen Kiwi and Ninja Kiwi in the same room\u2026"
  offensiveAbility: Kiwi fires a laser beam from its eyes to hit the ball, which
    automatically counts as the next action required for the ball in the rally. (15s
    cooldown)
  offensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3ef13db8c4563484bba6c89bc82c1366, type: 3}
  defensiveAbility: Stealth Burrowing - Kiwi burrows underground, becoming faster
    while also ignoring field effects. When the ability ends (button press or time
    running out), Kiwi jumps out of the ground (12s cooldown after coming out of
    the ground)
  defensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 73df00bf92bb9a744a057dd8d19b8a06, type: 3}
  groundSpeed: 6
  jumpForce: 7
  strength: 4
